//│ ╙──       	        ^
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Wasm function `takeTop` expects result to have type `(ref null any)`, but got `i32`
//│ ║  l.448: 	fun takeTop(m: Int32) = m
//│ ╙──       	^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
